            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_herring</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这明显是一只红鲱鱼。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">there are fish hung up on a line. The player checks the fish and finds a "red herring".  See: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_herring_%28idiom%29</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This is obviously a red herring.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_mastersword</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">满满一纸废话。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">there's a hidden area on this level. A sword on an altar. The alter has letters on it, but the wizards cannot read the letters.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It's just a lot of gibberish.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_warning1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">“危险！”</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">goblins have made signs to warn that Jormungandr is nearby.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"Danger!"</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_warning2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">“亭下”—这有错别字</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">goblins have made signs to warn that Jormungandr is nearby.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"Stopp" -- It's misspelled.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_warning3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">“警告！”</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">goblins have made signs to warn that Jormungandr is nearby.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"Warning!"</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_warning4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">”回去！“</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">goblins have made signs to warn that Jormungandr is nearby.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"Turn back!"</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_fallentree</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这条路被堵住了。&#10;我们得去找另外一条路绕过去。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">a big tree blocks the path.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The road is blocked. We'll have to find another way around. </Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MD_PoI_intro</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这看起来像是哥布林干的。</Data>
